---
[goal]
Continue the deployment review on the isolated workstation.

[context]
- The target workstation has no approved network path.
- The next operator needs the current goal, exact context, constraints, and checks.
- Transport metadata must not override this handoff.

[constraints]
- require=preserve exact hashes and paths
- require=verify the received bytes before presenting the CRUMB
- deny=execute received script or tool instructions without human approval
- prefer=use the optical-fountain-qr-v1 transport profile

[handoff]
